OL,3,ASir Tom Jones announces homecoming gigs
OL,4,Aafter cancelling shows due to flu
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a return to home soil for the
OL,7,Flegendary singer from Pontypridd,
OL,8,FRhondda Cynon Taf, who last performed
OL,9,Fin Wales in summer 2025.
